      <file role="new">scripts/intake/Apply-IntakeApprovalPolicy.ps1 (policy + published version, D-14; copy scripts/Apply-DoLanePolicies.ps1). Writing it is in scope; RUNNING it on dev needs the owner's go</file>
      <file role="new">tests/integration/contract/Api/Intake/IntakeApprovalContractTests.cs, tests/integration/auth/Intake/IntakeApprovalAuthorizationTests.cs, tests/integration/data-mutation/Intake/IntakeApprovalServiceTests.cs, tests/integration/seam/Intake/IntakeApprovalDecideLaneSeamTests.cs</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Signals/DecisionCommitService.cs (step 1d: every step's preflight runs as the caller before any write)</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Signals/Actions/InquiryDispositionService.cs and BudgetInquiryExecutor.cs (outbound inquiries share sprk_servicerequest; DO NOT change these paths)</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Signals/WorkItemPrivilege.cs (batched as-the-caller read, fail closed)</file>
